nnounce the results of any revisions to any of such statements to reflect future events or developments, except as required by law.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 View original content to download multimedia:\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/eightco-holdings-nasdaq-orbs-reports-total-holdings-of-approximately-436-million-includes-openai-beast-industries-more-than-16-000-eth-and-over-283-million-wld-tokens-302810117.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/eightco-holdings-nasdaq-orbs-reports-total-holdings-of-approximately-436-million-includes-openai-beast-industries-more-than-16-000-eth-and-over-283-million-wld-tokens-302810117.html}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 SOURCE Eightco Holdings (NASDAQ: ORBS)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 25, 2026 08:35 ET (12:35 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p001xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
